  "notes": "{配置|はいち} is a noun that can function as a suru verb ({配置|はいち}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧). It emphasizes deliberate, planned placement.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- [thing/person]⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{配置|はいち}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to place/deploy something)\n- [thing]⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{配置|はいち} (the arrangement of something)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {人員|じんいん}{配置|はいち} (personnel deployment)\n- {配置|はいち}{転換|てんかん} (redeployment, reassignment)\n- {配置|はいち}⟦{図|ず}→図：03368_zu⟧ (layout diagram)\n- {配置|はいち}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{変|か}える→変える：01089_kaeru⟧ (change the arrangement)\n\n{配置|はいち}{転換|てんかん} (redeployment) is a common workplace term for reassigning employees to different positions or departments within the same organization.",
